<title>THAILAND: GOLF-HONDA CLASSIC FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-HONDA CLASSIC FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in</p>
<p>$300,000 Honda Classic golf tournament at the par 72 Thai</p>
<p>Country Club on Thursday:</p>
<p>66 Lee Petters (United Arab Emirates)</p>
<p>67 Clay Devers (U.S.), Prayad Marksaeng (Thailand)</p>
<p>68 Curtis Strange (U.S.), Edmund Fryatt (Britain),</p>
<p>Brad Andrews (Australia), Carlos Espinosa (Mexico)</p>
<p>69 Jim Rutledge (U.S.), Kyi Hla Han (Burma), Kang</p>
<p>Wook-soon (South Korea), Takao Nogami (Japan),</p>
<p>Mike Cunning (U.S.), Joon Chung (South Korea),</p>
<p>Chang Tse-peng (Taiwan)</p>
<p>70 Imdad Hussain (Pakistan), Greg Hanrahan (U.S.),</p>
<p>Mo Jong-kyung (South Korea), Frank Nobilo</p>
<p>(New Zealand), Zhang Lian-wel (China), M.Ramayah</p>
<p>(Singapore), Tiger Woods (U.S.), Supha Veerawut</p>
<p>(Thailand)</p>
</text>
